Z||000000||Phil||07-13-99||05:43 PM||||Don't know what you did Cliff but now all the new posts are in the correct order. Maybe it was just my set up but sure is nice having the latest on top.
Z||000001||Cliff Pennock||07-13-99||06:06 PM||||Actually, I didn't do anything... I noticed that sometimes older messages get on top of newer messages - but not always. It has something to do with the server-time not being the same as the time of the poster's machine (especially when the server thinks it's already the next day while it actually isn't in the States because of the time-difference). I haven't found that bug yet - or better yet, haven't really looked for it since I didn't thought it was all that important. But I'll have a look at it as soon as I return from my holiday.<br>
